进而引发 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态和 Pod 挂起。证据链完整：\n- **原因端**：远程仓库返回 `NotFound` (fact-1)\n- **机制端**：Kubelet 报错 `Failed to pull` 并进入 `BackOff` (fact-2, fact-3)\n- **现象端**：Pod 状态为 `Pending` (fact-4)，指标显示 `waiting_reason=ImagePullBackOff` (fact-5) 且 `restarts=0` (fact-6)\n\n现有证据足以确诊根因，无需补充其他决定性事实。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v07/workload: 29.8s (Evidence 23.2s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v07/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 60.906, "metrics": {"run_id": "44342c75b5b6425b", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 60.914475440979004, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}],